& Cell\nNSS Unit\nWomen Cell\nCareer Counseling & Placement Cell\nDigital Learning & Literacy Cell\nResearch & Development Cell\nST/SC Cell\nStudent Activities\nElectoral Literacy Club (ELC)\nMeeting Minutes\nActivities\n1\n|\n2\n|\n3\n|\n4\n|\n5\n|\n6\n|\n7\nIQAC\nNAAC\nNIRF\nONLINE REGISTRATION PORTAL (SAMARTH)\nPrincipal’s Message\nThe Institutions of higher learning have been forever envisaged to cater Knowledge-cum-information enriched education to the educational aspirants.Pub Majuli College was established with that very vision in mind and till today it has been engrossed in that very mission by extending the light of education to all sections of the society. Pub Majuli College is the only premier educational institution which input social science education at higher level to the people of the entire Pub Majuli area of Majuli District since its inception in 1990 with a\nRead More\nPub Majuli College – A Glance\nEstablished in 1990,Pub Majuli College remains the premiere institute of higher education ,imparting knowledge to the entire localities of greater Pub Majuli Area of Majuli island and its nearby area. The College is brought under Provincialisation in August,2013 and is affiliated to Dibrugarh University . The College is recognized by the University Grnats Commission Act,1956.The College offered Under-graduate degrees in Arts under the affiliating University. Besides it runs various programmes under Krishna Kanta Handiqui State Open University. The\nRead More\nAdmission Notice2026-2027\nAdmission Notice 2026-27\nSelected Students  are informed to  attend the College with Original documents on 04,05 and 06 June,2026 for admission without fail. Those who are not selected in the First Merit List, please keep patience upto 8th...\nRead more...\nSpot Admission\nThis is inform to all aspiring candidates that the Spot Admission Process will be held as per the guidelines of SAMARTH PORTAL.\nNotification\nHELP DESK : 8638341822\nRead more...\nSpot Admission\nThis is to inform that Spot Admission for B.A 1st Semester(FYUGP) 2025-2026 will be held as per the attached guidelines of SAMARTH Portal.\nGUIDELINE\nHELP DESK: 8638341822\nRead more...\nSPOT ADMISSION 2026-27\nIt is hereby notified for information to all concerned candidates that a few seats are vacant for admission into *B.A. 1st Semester* under the Four-Year Undergraduate Programme (FYUGP) for the academic session 2026-2027.Desiring candidates who have...\nRead more...\nOnline Registration Form\nFaculty Development Programme on \"Use of ICT Tools for ClassroomTeaching\"\nKKHSOU Study Centre\nANNOUNCEMENT\nSELECTED LIST OF STUDENTS FOR ADMISSION 2026-2027\nROUND 01\nFIRST MERIT LIST\nROUND 02\nSECOND MERIT LIST\nAchievements\nInstitutional Distinctiveness:\nAcademic Achievements:\nOther Achievements:\nActivities:\nAwards\n***Best Graduate Awards\n(A Cash money of Rs.5000.00(Five thousand) is given to the Best Graduate of Pub Majuli College. This award is given by the College authority every year.)\nDibrugarh University\nHoliday List 2023\nDibrugarh University\nPostal Address\nPub Majuli College\nPO-Bongaon, District- Majuli\n(Earlierly known as Jorhat District)\n785110, (Assam)\nMobile. +91 84748 43324\nFax. 03775 271071\nE-Mail: pubmajulicollege@gmail.com\nStudent Corner\nRules & Regulations\nDress Code\nModel Student Charter\nCollege Magazine\nStudent Union Body Members\nAlumni\nAnti Ragging\nInformation\nMinimum Disclosure Norms\nEnrollment and Exam Result\nTeaching Staff Profile\nFacilities & Infrastructure\nIncome & Expenditure\nNAAC / IQAC\nGeo Location", "links": [{"label": "Contact", "url": "https://pubmajulicollege.org/index.php/contact"}, {"label": "Privacy Policy", "url": "https://pubmajulicollege.org/index.php/privacy-policy"}, {"label": "Contact", "url": "https://pubmajulicollege.org/index.php/contact"}, {"label": "Privacy Policy", "url": "https://pubmajulicollege.org/index.php/privacy-policy"}, {"label": "Home", "url": "https://pubmajulicollege.org/ind